{"sha": "5824fa04522d3bd62baac7de3614bb2e45e61c73ab0ecb1dbcd0aed4a547a67f", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g11:lenses-and-eye} 章 --- 透镜、成像与眼睛}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:lenses-and-eye:1}", "$C = 1/0.50 = +2.0$~屈光度；$1/(-0.20) = -5.0$~屈光度；$1/0.0040 = +250$~屈光度。", "一块 $+8.0$~屈光度的透镜：$f' = 1/8.0 = \\qty{0.125}{m} = \\qty{12.5}{cm}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:lenses-and-eye:2}", "凹透镜（$f' < 0$）。不能。对任意物距 $d$，", "$\\gamma = f'/(f' - d)$（见\\cref{exo:g11:lenses-and-eye:15}）", "介于 $0$ 与 $1$ 之间，像总是", "虚像、正立且\\emph{缩小}。印刷字样看起来正立", "而又缩小，从不放大。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:lenses-and-eye:3}", "物体位于 $2f'$ 处；过光心的光线与平行光线相交于", "透镜后 \\qty{20}{cm} 处。校验：", "$1/\\overline{OA'} = 1/10 - 1/20 = 1/20$，故", "$\\overline{OA'} = +\\qty{20}{cm}$，$\\gamma = 20/(-20) = -1$：实像，", "倒立、等大——与图中一致。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:lenses-and-eye:4}", "$1/\\overline{OA'} = 1/8.0 - 1/24 = 1/12$：", "$\\overline{OA'} = +\\qty{12}{cm}$，$\\gamma = 12/(-24) = -0.50$。实", "像位于透镜后 \\qty{12}{cm} 处，倒立，大小为原物的一半。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:lenses-and-eye:5}", "角膜与晶状体共同构成凸透镜；视网膜", "即屏幕。调节改变的是晶状体的焦距（光焦度），", "而晶状体与视网膜间的距离不能改变。近", "点：在完全调节时清晰可见的最近点——", "对标准眼而言为 \\qty{25}{cm}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:lenses-and-eye:6}", "风景照：感光元件位于焦平面，距透镜 \\qty{50}{mm}。在", "\\qty{3.0}{m} 处：$1/\\overline{OA'} = 1/50 - 1/3000 = 59/3000$，故", "$\\overline{OA'} \\approx \\qty{50.8}{mm}$。行程约为 \\qty{0.8}{mm}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:lenses-and-eye:7}", "$1/\\overline{OA'} = 1/6.0 - 1/5.0 = -1/30$：", "$\\overline{OA'} = \\qty{-30}{cm}$——虚像、正立，", "$\\gamma = (-30)/(-5.0) = +6.0$：像为邮票的六倍大，", "在透镜同侧 \\qty{30}{cm} 处。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:lenses-and-eye:8}", "$1/f' = 1/40 + 1/40 = 1/20$：$f' = \\qty{20}{cm}$；", "$\\gamma = 40/(-40) = -1$。对称性要求", "$\\abs{\\overline{OA'}} = \\abs{\\overline{OA}}$，因此", "$\\abs{\\gamma} = 1$；像为实像且倒立，故 $\\gamma = -1$：", "恰好等大。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:lenses-and-eye:9}", "$1/\\overline{OA'} = -1/25 - 1/50 = -3/50$：", "$\\overline{OA'} \\approx \\qty{-16.7}{cm}$，", "$\\gamma = (-16.7)/(-50) = +0.33$：虚像、正立，像的大小为", "原来的三分之一。近视者的眼镜是凹透镜：通过它们看到的一切", "——包括从外面看到的佩戴者的眼睛——都是缩小的。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:lenses-and-eye:10}", "无穷远物体的像在远点处：$f' = \\qty{-0.40}{m}$，故", "$C = -2.5$~屈光度。山的像位于", "透镜前 \\qty{40}{cm} 处，恰为远点，放松的眼睛", "无需调节即可清晰看到。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:lenses-and-eye:11}", "$C = 1/\\overline{OA'} - 1/\\overline{OA} = 1/(-0.80) - 1/(-0.25)", "= -1.25 + 4.00 = +2.75$~屈光度。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:lenses-and-eye:12}", "\\emph{1.} $\\gamma = \\overline{OA'}/\\overline{OA} = -50$，得", "$\\overline{OA'} = -50\\,\\overline{OA}$；结合", "$\\overline{OA'} - \\overline{OA} = \\qty{5.1}{m}$，", "$-51\\,\\overline{OA} = \\qty{5.1}{m}$：$\\overline{OA} = \\qty{-0.10}{m}$，", "$\\overline{OA'} = +\\qty{5.0}{m}$。", "", "\\emph{2.} $1/f' = 1/5.0 + 1/0.10 = 10.2$：$f' \\approx \\qty{9.8}{cm}$。", "", "\\emph{3.} $50 \\times \\qty{24}{mm} = \\qty{1.2}{m}$，倒立——这", "正是幻灯片要倒着装入的原因。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:lenses-and-eye:13}", "\\emph{1.} $C_\\infty = 1/0.017 \\approx 59$~屈光度；", "$C_{25} = 1/0.017 + 1/0.25 \\approx 63$~屈光度。振幅：", "$1/0.25 = 4.0$~屈光度。", "", "\\emph{2.} 振幅 $= 1/1.0 = 1.0$~屈光度：仅余", "四分之一（$25\\%$）的标准眼 $4.0$~屈光度。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:lenses-and-eye:14}", "\\emph{1.} $f' = 0.25/3 \\approx \\qty{0.083}{m} = \\qty{8.3}{cm}$。", "", "\\emph{2.} $\\overline{OA'} = \\qty{-25}{cm}$：", "$1/\\overline{OA} = -1/25 - 3/25 = -4/25$，故", "$\\overline{OA} = \\qty{-6.25}{cm}$，且", "$\\gamma = (-25)/(-6.25) = +4.0$——优于标称的", "$\\times 3$（该值假定像位于无穷远）；将像移至", "近点时可再增益一个单位。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}